#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_kpl.rst:-1
msgid "The Krita Palette file format."
msgstr "Krita 色板文件格式介绍。"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_kpl.rst:10
msgid "*.kpl"
msgstr "*.kpl"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_kpl.rst:10
msgid "KPL"
msgstr "KPL"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_kpl.rst:10
msgid "Krita Palette"
msgstr "Krita 色板"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_kpl.rst:15
msgid "\\*.kpl"
msgstr "\\*.kpl"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_kpl.rst:17
msgid ""
"Since 4.0, Krita has a new palette file-format that can handle colors that "
"are wide gamut, RGB, CMYK, XYZ, GRAY, or LAB, and can be of any of the "
"available bitdepths, as well as groups. These are Krita Palettes, or ``*."
"kpl``."
msgstr ""
"自 4.0 版起，Krita 内建了一种全新的色板文件格式。它支持宽色域颜色，包括 RGB、"
"CMYK、XYZ、GRAY、和 LAB 等，也兼容任意一种色彩位深度，还可以对颜色进行分组。"
"这便是 Krita 色板文件，或 ``*.kpl``。"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_kpl.rst:19
msgid ""
"``*.kpl`` files are ZIP files, with two XMLs and ICC profiles inside. The "
"*colorset.xml* file contains the swatches as ColorSetEntry and Groups as "
"Group. The *profiles.xml* file contains a list of profiles, and the ICC "
"profiles themselves are embedded to ensure compatibility over different "
"computers."
msgstr ""
"``*.kpl`` 本质上是一个 ZIP 文件，它打包了 2 个 XML 文件和 1 个 ICC 配置文件。"
"*colorset.xml* 文件保存的是色板，文件中的 ColorSetEntry 项是色块，Group 项是"
"色块组。*profiles.xml* 文件保存的是色彩特性文件清单，它们的 ICC 特性文件也被"
"嵌入其中，以确保它们能在不同计算机下面正常工作。"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_kpl.rst:21
msgid ""
"A technical description in English can be found in :ref:`here "
"<kpl_format_definition>`."
msgstr ""
"KPL 格式的英文技术描述请\\ :ref:`访问此页面 <kpl_format_definition>`\\ 。"
